</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2a3c5e42-a141-11f1-ada9-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-A6VY2T7.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2a3c5e42-a141-11f1-ada9-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-A6VY2T7.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9675681e-a237-11f1-a00f-9bea45efef3a</guid><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:01:20 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2a3c5e42-a141-11f1-ada9-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-A6VY2T7.jpg">AFP - SAUL LOEB</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>习近平派李强赴西藏洪水泥石流灾区视察</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260827-%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E6%B4%BE%E6%9D%8E%E5%BC%BA%E8%B5%B4%E8%A5%BF%E8%97%8F%E6%B4%AA%E6%B0%B4%E6%B3%A5%E7%9F%B3%E6%B5%81%E7%81%BE%E5%8C%BA%E8%A7%86%E5%AF%9F</link><description>
