</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fcbd725e-a243-11f1-821f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Ye-Jianchun.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fcbd725e-a243-11f1-821f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Ye-Jianchun.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ec1367ac-a242-11f1-84b8-4de807e7fa63</guid><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:21:15 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/fcbd725e-a243-11f1-821f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Ye-Jianchun.jpg">© X</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>挪威国王病危 全国摒息 首相取消访德行程</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260827-%E6%8C%AA%E5%A8%81%E5%9B%BD%E7%8E%8B%E7%97%85%E5%8D%B1-%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E6%91%92%E6%81%AF-%E9%A6%96%E7%9B%B8%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%E8%AE%BF%E5%BE%B7</link><description>
